{"id":"00238","root":"uni00238_1","name":{"ja":"秋山　凜子","en":"Akiyama Rinko"},"title":{"ja":"【高嶺の花】","en":"【Unattainable Flower】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【高嶺の花】 秋山　凜子","en":"【Unattainable Flower】 Akiyama Rinko"},"aliases":["Demon Rinko"],"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-09-12","limited":false,"characterId":1,"profile":{"ja":"五車学園の先輩で対魔忍。ゆきかぜの幼馴染にして姉のような存在である。忍の里に代々伝わる剣術『逸刀流』の皆伝で、“斬鬼の対魔忍”と恐れられる手練の美しき剣客。妹（ゆきかぜ）と弟（達郎）の世話をやくのが趣味で二人にはとことん優しく包容力があり、甘いところも多々あるが、それは二人だけに見せる一面で、学園では強く美しく厳しい先輩として見られている。恋愛より妹弟を愛でるのが楽しいためか、数多の男子の求愛にまったく興味を示さない。女子生徒の中ではレズ説が囁かれ、秘かに凜子様ファンクラブなるものが存在し強い広がりを見せているが本人は至ってノーマル。常にゆきかぜと行動をともにし、彼女を献身的にサポートしている。","en":"Akiyama Rinko is a senior at Gosha Academy and a Taimanin. She is Mizuki Yukikaze's childhood friend and serves as an older-sister figure to her. Rinko has mastered the hereditary sword style \"Itsutō-ryū\" passed down through generations of ninja villages, earning her the fearsome title \"Demon-slaying Taimanin,\" a skilled and beautiful swordswoman. She enjoys caring for her younger sister (Yukikaze) and younger brother (Akiyama Tatsuro), showing them boundless kindness and a gentle, indulgent side that she reserves only for them; at the academy she is regarded as a strong, beautiful, and strict senior. She shows no interest in the countless suitors vying for her affection, preferring to dote on her siblings. Rumors of a lesbian inclination circulate among the female students, and a secret \"Lady Rinko fan club\" has quietly flourished, though she herself remains perfectly normal. She is constantly by Yukikaze's side, devotedly supporting her in every way."},"illustrator":"葵渚","voiceActor":"北板利亜","forms":[{"id":"uni00238_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1170,2340],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[192,384],"def":[119,238],"spd":[63,63],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","310004"]},{"id":"uni00238_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats"